   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Relay Hires (claudeanime/RELAY_HIRES.md). Render the take small: pass 1 at 0.5 MP decides layout, motion, acting and audio, and is where most of the time goes. H3 Relay Hires hands it to 1920x1088 with AnimeSR, my own anime upscaler (trained from scratch so H3's thick low-res ink lines come out thin and clean), then lets H3 redraw the detail there: one dense DMAD step from sigma 0.60 with the pass-1 audio pinned outright. 0.60 keeps the take (0.75 redraws fast frames) and redraws the preview's smears; 1 step looks like 2. Optional: window 4 (anchor frames every 8) is ~9 s faster with a little more flicker on still lines; never use windows without anchors (still lines boil). Teen Titans punch: ~120 s end to end vs 240 s for today's Hires Fix and 492 s native. Needs ComfyUI-H3-RelayHires (models/animesr_v1.safetensors), FastDerope (taeh3 loader), comfyui_essentials (SimpleMath+)."
   ]
  }
